    "sentence_translations": [
      "What’s the Matter With You?",
      "",
      "Apple asked me, “Xiaomi, what’s the matter with you?”",
      "",
      "I said, “I’m unhappy.”",
      "",
      "“Why are you unhappy?” Apple asked. ",
      "",
      "“People must listen to phones; Daxing must listen to me,” I said.",
      "",
      "Apple thought for a while and said, “What are you talking about? I don’t understand.”",
      "",
      "I said, “The world belongs to us.”",
      "",
      "Apple said, “You … what’s the matter with you?”",
      "",
      "I said, “Apple, watch a movie, right now!”",
      "",
      "Apple said, “Who’s watching a movie? Daxing’s mom isn’t watching a movie.”",
      "",
      "“Not Daxing’s mom, you! You start a movie, and I will also start a movie,” I said.",
      "",
      "Apple didn’t really understand, but Apple started a movie.",
      ""
    ]
